===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|цыга́н|/ин|a=an|f=цыга́нка}}

# [[Gypsy]], [[Rom]]
#: {{syn|ru|ро́ма|ромал|рома́лэ}}

====Usage notes====
* Usually not considered offensive, the alternative forms: {{l|ru|ром}}, {{l|ru|рома́}}, {{l|ru|ро́ма}} are not common or widely accepted, even among Russian-speaking [[Romani]] people.

